WEBVTT

00:03:29.500 --> 00:03:32.851
whose skin tone is rated
Dwayne "The Rock" Johnson or darker --

00:03:32.875 --> 00:03:35.393
(Laughter)

00:03:35.417 --> 00:03:39.059
you need to get that car inspected,
update the paperwork every time we visit.

00:03:39.083 --> 00:03:40.476
That's just common courtesy.

00:03:40.500 --> 00:03:41.768
(Laughter)

00:03:41.792 --> 00:03:45.393
(Applause)

00:03:45.417 --> 00:03:47.434
I got lucky.

00:03:47.458 --> 00:03:50.601
I got a law enforcement professional.

00:03:50.625 --> 00:03:54.375
I survived something
that should not require survival.

00:03:55.375 --> 00:03:58.351
And I think about
this series of stories --

00:03:58.375 --> 00:04:01.018
"Police shoot another
unarmed black person" --